{{else if (eq phpWebFramework "symfony")}}
`src/Kernel.php` owns bundles and services, `src/Controller/ApiController.php` owns routes, `src/EventSubscriber/HttpContractSubscriber.php` owns CORS and JSON errors, and `src/Greeting.php` owns typed input validation. Add behavior here {{#if (eq phpTesting "none")}}and{{else}}with request-level {{#if (eq phpTesting "pest")}}Pest{{else if (eq phpTesting "codeception")}}Codeception{{else}}PHPUnit{{/if}} tests;{{/if}} keep `bin/proof-http.php` aligned with the public HTTP contract. Composer remains the dependency authority. TypeScript package processors must not modify this service.
{{else}}
`src/Application.php` owns routes and middleware. `src/Greeting.php` owns typed input validation. Add behavior here {{#if (eq phpTesting "none")}}and{{else}}with request-level {{#if (eq phpTesting "pest")}}Pest{{else if (eq phpTesting "codeception")}}Codeception{{else}}PHPUnit{{/if}} tests;{{/if}} keep `bin/proof-http.php` aligned with the public HTTP contract. Composer remains the dependency authority. TypeScript package processors must not modify this service.
